<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Just In Love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Joe Jonas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Fastlife</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">61bI9JHBji9VYBqQL9Migt</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.250" end="00:09.250">Just in Love -Joe Jonas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.287" end="00:22.726">I love a girl in a whole another language</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.726" end="00:25.860">People look at us strange</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.860" end="00:27.360">Don't understand us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.175" end="00:27.675">They try to change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.415" end="00:29.895">I try to tell her don't change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.895" end="00:32.385">We talk love and they say it sounds crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.385" end="00:34.743">Love's even more wild when you're angry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.743" end="00:37.183">Don't understand why you wanna change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.183" end="00:38.692">Girl listen to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.692" end="00:43.412">You're just running from the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.412" end="00:48.202">But I'm scared of losing you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.202" end="00:53.102">You are worth too much to lose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.102" end="00:57.482">Baby if you're still confused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.482" end="00:58.982">Girl I'm just</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.122" end="01:02.592">Girl I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.592" end="01:07.411">Girl I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.411" end="01:12.191">No other words to use</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.191" end="01:16.681">I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.681" end="01:24.681">I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.278" end="02:05.980">Girl I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.980" end="02:09.837">Girl I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.837" end="02:14.517">No other words to use</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.517" end="02:19.247">I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.247" end="02:23.936">I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.936" end="02:30.905">I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.905" end="02:33.174">Never knew what we have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.174" end="02:35.664">They don't understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.664" end="02:40.434">What is just a waste of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.434" end="02:42.774">We know this is real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.774" end="02:45.184">And I know how you feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.184" end="02:48.193">When you put your hand in mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.193" end="02:52.993">Girl I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.993" end="02:58.330">Girl I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.330" end="03:02.552">No other words to use</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.552" end="03:05.731">I'm just in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.731" end="03:09.670">Let me say it again let me say it again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.670" end="03:12.160">Just in love just in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.160" end="03:16.160">I'm just in love with you</p></div></body></tt>